{
  "_comment": "Exported from the corresponding USDA (stylized_gait reference animation generator, Hopkins et al. 2024, sample 'step_in_place'). All 10 actuated joints extracted (indices 1-10 of the source SkelAnimation's 11-joint 'rotations' array; index 0 is the root and excluded). Each quaternion encodes rotation about a single local axis per joint (yaw: Z, roll: Y, pitch/knee/ankle: X), recovered as angle_deg = degrees(2*atan2(component, w)). Sign convention (per user confirmation, revised): left_yaw, left_roll, left_pitch, left_knee are inverted (negated); left_ankle is left as extracted. right_yaw, right_roll, right_ankle are inverted; right_pitch, right_knee are left as extracted. A constant per-joint offset was then added to every keyframe so the trajectory is centered on the stable base pose found during policy training (left_pitch -16, left_knee +10, left_ankle +1, right_pitch +16, right_knee -10, right_ankle -1; yaw/roll unaffected) instead of the all-zero pose. Time values (and cyclePeriod_s) scaled by 2x relative to the original extracted timing, to play back 2x slower for testing -- joint angle values themselves are unchanged. MODIFIED 2026-09-03: right_pitch/right_knee/right_ankle over keyframe indices 31-39 (t=1.033-1.3), and the mirrored left_pitch/left_knee/left_ankle over indices 64-6 wrapping through the 2.2s/0.0s cycle boundary, were re-smoothed with a minimum-jerk (zero velocity/acceleration at both ends) interpolation between their original boundary values at idx30/idx40 (and idx63/idx7 for the wrapped side) -- those values are UNCHANGED, only the interior points were recomputed. Original data had a genuine C1 discontinuity right at each leg's swing onset (idx30-33 was essentially idle, ~0.03 deg/step, then idx33-34 jumped instantly to 2.83 deg/step with no ramp-up) that we traced, via real robot_deploy.py failures on 2026-09-01/02 and direct probing of the exported policy.pt, to a reproducible policy-side runaway (one joint's commanded target saturating within 2-3 real 20ms steps) right at this exact phase. Peak single-step delta in the smoothed window dropped from 2.83 to 2.08 deg. roll and yaw were untouched -- roll's own reference was already smooth through this region (no kink), and yaw is constant 0 throughout.",
